sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant A as Streamlit app
  participant C as QueryCache (SQLite)
  participant R as Dense retriever (Chroma)
  participant K as Scope classifier
  participant L as Ollama llama3.2
  U->>A: question
  A->>C: get(question)
  alt exact hit or safe semantic hit
    C-->>A: cached answer
    A-->>U: answer (served from cache)
  else cache miss
    A->>R: search(question, top 5)
    R-->>A: chunks + cosine scores
    alt best score below 0.5
      A-->>U: refusal (layer 1)
    else score is high enough
      A->>K: is_in_scope(question)
      alt out of scope
        A-->>U: refusal (layer 2)
      else in scope
        A->>L: prompt with numbered sources
        L-->>A: answer with [n] citations
        alt model says not enough information
          A-->>U: refusal (layer 3)
        else answered
          A->>C: put(question, answer)
          A-->>U: answer + cited sources
        end
      end
    end
  end
